WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.008
Bird was sick.

2
00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:14.551
Her throat was scratchy and her head hurt.

3
00:00:14.552 --> 00:00:18.542
Even her feet ached.

4
00:00:18.543 --> 00:00:28.321
"I feel awful!" moaned Bird.

5
00:00:28.322 --> 00:00:31.506
"Poor Bird," thought Kip.

6
00:00:31.507 --> 00:00:41.786
Kip wanted to help Bird feel better.

7
00:00:41.787 --> 00:00:47.690
"I will bring something to her," he said.

8
00:00:47.691 --> 00:00:53.815
Kip thought about what Bird liked.

9
00:00:53.816 --> 00:00:56.968
Then he had an idea.

10
00:00:56.969 --> 00:01:00.754
"Pizza crust!" said Kip.

11
00:01:00.755 --> 00:01:06.071
"Bird loves pizza crust.

12
00:01:06.072 --> 00:01:18.516
I'll find a good one for Bird."

13
00:01:18.517 --> 00:01:39.340
Kip went to the boardwalk.

14
00:01:39.341 --> 00:01:51.430
He looked in some trash cans.

15
00:01:51.431 --> 00:02:01.680
Soon Kip found a perfect pizza crust.

16
00:02:01.681 --> 00:02:05.438
It had the brown bubbles Bird liked.

17
00:02:05.439 --> 00:02:14.406
"Bird will love this!" Kip said.

18
00:02:14.407 --> 00:02:20.133
On the way home, Kip saw Seagull.

19
00:02:20.134 --> 00:02:23.887
"Hi, Seagull," said Kip.

20
00:02:23.888 --> 00:02:27.790
"Bird is sick.

21
00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:30.753
I'm bringing a pizza crust to her."

22
00:02:30.754 --> 00:02:33.274
Seagull looked at the pizza crust.

23
00:02:33.275 --> 00:02:36.106
"Hmm," said Seagull.

24
00:02:36.107 --> 00:02:41.833
"I don't think that's a good idea."

